name: roaming_imsi_footprint
title: "Roaming subscriber footprint"
description: "Each roaming subscriber linked to the visited networks that billed them (synthetic numbers starting 001). A normal roamer touches one or two partners; subscriber 001010000000042 touches four in three days, an impossible journey. Explain node and Centrality bring it to the top."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force-cluster
profile: telecom
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: roaming_tap_dataset
    sourceCol: IMSI
    targetCol: SENDER_NAME
    linkKindCol: EVENT_TYPE
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
